        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 350000\n    fully_indexed_rate = 0.05\n    loan_term_months = 240\n\n    # Calculate the monthly payment using the amortization formula\n    monthly_rate = fully_indexed_rate / 12\n    monthly_payment = principal * (\n        monthly_rate * (1 + monthly_rate) ** loan_term_months\n    ) / ((1 + monthly_rate) ** loan_term_months - 1)\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest cent\n    return round(monthly_payment, 2)\n```",
